  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Bienvenid<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa al Café Cuco.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690065006E00760065006E0069006400100003110000FF0101006F006100200061006C002000430061006600E90020004300750063006F002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tal y como indica su nombre, es un espacio cuco\ny muy tranquilo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540061006C0020007900200063006F006D006F00200069006E00640069006300610020007300750020006E006F006D006200720065002C00200065007300200075006E0020006500730070006100630069006F0020006300750063006F000A00790020006D007500790020007400720061006E007100750069006C006F002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En el pasado nos hicimos tan populares que no\ndábamos abasto con la cantidad de clientes.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Era tan frenética la atmósfera que me subía por\nlas paredes. No podía aguantar ese ritmo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por otra parte, el negocio se iría a pique sin\nclientes. Es todo un dilema...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Entiendes el problema que tenemos?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0045006E007400690065006E00640065007300200065006C002000700072006F0062006C0065006D00610020007100750065002000740065006E0065006D006F0073003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La verdad es que no",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0061002000760065007200640061006400200065007300200071007500650020006E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No soy Médium...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00200073006F00790020004D00E9006400690075006D002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En resumen: quiero que solo vengan los clientes\njustos para pasar el día y no arruinarnos.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nY para ello tengo que dar con un menú idóneo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué podríamos ofrecer?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E900200070006F0064007200ED0061006D006F00730020006F006600720065006300650072003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Galettes Luminalia",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470061006C006500740074006500730020004C0075006D0069006E0061006C006900610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cruasanes",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300720075006100730061006E006500730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Arroz al curri",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100720072006F007A00200061006C0020006300750072007200690000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, las Galettes Luminalia se venden por todas\npartes. No sería nada novedoso.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Los que preparan en el Café Nouveau son\nuna auténtica delicia. No les haríamos sombra.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No quiero que nos comparen con el rico curri que\npreparan en el Hotel Z.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmm, ¿qué me dices de sushi?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006D006D002C002000BF0071007500E90020006D0065002000640069006300650073002000640065002000730075007300680069003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es una comida muy ligera... y no pega ni con cola\ncon un café. Creo que atraería a la cantidad justa<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nde clientes.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 121
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Está mal echarse flores, pero ¡es muy buena idea!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007400E10020006D0061006C0020006500630068006100720073006500200066006C006F007200650073002C0020007000650072006F002000A1006500730020006D007500790020006200750065006E006100200069006400650061002100100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El caso es que nunca he preparado sushi.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C0020006300610073006F00200065007300200071007500650020006E0075006E00630061002000680065002000700072006500700061007200610064006F002000730075007300680069002E00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y no pienso gastarme dinero en el restaurante\nSushi Tres Delicias.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSabes qué te voy a pedir, ¿verdad?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 109
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No hace falta que me respondas, veo en tu cara\nque no te lo imaginas: quiero que me muestres<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nun Tatsugiri. ¡En sus tres formas!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Cuál de las tres formas de Tatsugiri me quieres\nmostrar?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0043007500E1006C0020006400650020006C006100730020007400720065007300200066006F0072006D0061007300200064006500200054006100740073007500670069007200690020006D006500200071007500690065007200650073000A006D006F00730074007200610072003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Forma Curvada",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006F0072006D0061002000430075007200760061006400610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Forma Lánguida",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006F0072006D00610020004C00E1006E006700750069006400610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Forma Recta",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006F0072006D00610020005200650063007400610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ninguna por ahora",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E0069006E00670075006E006100200070006F0072002000610068006F007200610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oye, ¡no es la forma que me has dicho!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00790065002C002000A1006E006F0020006500730020006C006100200066006F0072006D006100200071007500650020006D0065002000680061007300200064006900630068006F002100100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero bueno, ¿no me vas a enseñar un Tatsugiri?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000650072006F0020006200750065006E006F002C002000BF006E006F0020006D006500200076006100730020006100200065006E0073006500F10061007200200075006E0020005400610074007300750067006900720069003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Anda, ¡un Tatsugiri Forma Curvada!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSería bien complicado doblar el filete de esa\nmanera, pero viene de perlas como ejemplo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 131
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Muchas gracias. Y ahora no te olvides de\nenseñarme el resto, ¿eh?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0075006300680061007300200067007200610063006900610073002E00200059002000610068006F007200610020006E006F0020007400650020006F006C00760069006400650073002000640065000A0065006E0073006500F100610072006D006500200065006C00200072006500730074006F002C002000BF00650068003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vaya, ¡un Tatsugiri Forma Lánguida!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCon esta forma podríamos esconder ingredientes\ndebajo y hacer sushi sorpresa. ¡Tomo nota!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 133
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Muchas gracias. Y ahora no te olvides de\nenseñarme el resto, ¿eh?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0075006300680061007300200067007200610063006900610073002E00200059002000610068006F007200610020006E006F0020007400650020006F006C00760069006400650073002000640065000A0065006E0073006500F100610072006D006500200065006C00200072006500730074006F002C002000BF00650068003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿$",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00240000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Un Tatsugiri Forma Recta!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCreo que quedaría genial si le pusiéramos algo\nencima al sushi. Habrá que pensárselo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 120
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Muchas gracias. Y ahora no te olvides de\nenseñarme el resto, ¿eh?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0075006300680061007300200067007200610063006900610073002E00200059002000610068006F007200610020006E006F0020007400650020006F006C00760069006400650073002000640065000A0065006E0073006500F100610072006D006500200065006C00200072006500730074006F002C002000BF00650068003F00100002011401DE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿'",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te agradezco mucho que me hayas mostrado\nlas tres formas de Tatsugiri.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Creo que ya sé cómo preparar sushi. Dame\nun momento, veamos qué tal se me da.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué te parece? Salta a la vista que no lo\nha hecho un experto, pero no está tan mal.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En mi opinión se venderá lo justo, ya que no es\npara tirar cohetes que digamos.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǞ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero bueno, ¡¿qué es esto?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000650072006F0020006200750065006E006F002C002000A100BF0071007500E90020006500730020006500730074006F003F002100100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Café con sushi?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100BF00430061006600E900200063006F006E002000730075007300680069003F002100100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡A quién se le ocurre! ¡Desde luego, la oferta\ngastronómica de esta ciudad es única!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No pienso probarlo, pero sí siento la imperante\nnecesidad de compartirlo con el mundo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 5944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Para los que veáis este vídeo, ¡alucinad con\neste menú tan curioso!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007200610020006C006F0073002000710075006500200076006500E100690073002000650073007400650020007600ED00640065006F002C002000A10061006C007500630069006E0061006400200063006F006E000A00650073007400650020006D0065006E00FA002000740061006E00200063007500720069006F0073006F002100100002011401DF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Os presento una novedad con la que vais a flipar:\n¡café con sushi! ¿Cómo os quedáis?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi os apetece probarlo, ¡venid al Café Cuco!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 6272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 137
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si es que no puedo resistirme a compartir estas\nmaravillas que ofrece este mundo, soy la monda.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 6548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hemos llegado! Aquí es donde sirven café con\nsushi.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
